# Private key material, certificates, and provider credential files. Eyvan
# generates what it needs under ~/.eyvan at runtime; nothing of the sort
# belongs in the tree.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*credentials*.json
google-cloud-credentials.json


# Where a `--with` job caches its packages when /var/lib/eyvan is not writable,
# which is every laptop. Submitting from a checkout otherwise dirties the tree.
.eyvan-runtime-envs/
# Session-to-session engineering handoffs are working notes, not product; they
# name real incidents, hosts, and accounts, and have no business in a release.
.handoff/
.xerxes/
XERXES.md
# The built dashboard copied into the package for a release build
# (scripts/stage_dashboard.py); a build output, never source.
/eyvan/_dashboard/
